      "paperId": "929859b02efa1e44c4e52b8e31e2e6eec72b36d8",
      "title": "Moishe Postone and the Vicissitudes of Abstraction",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "M. Jay",
          "authorId": "47302396"
